  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ZAF: Analys o modellering av mineraler</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ZAF: Analysis and modelling of minerals - Analysis and modelling of minerals</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Genom ett samarbete mellan Uppsala Universitet i Sverige  och de      sydafrikanska akt&#xf6;rerna University of Witwatersrand samt Council for  Scientific and Industrial Research, ska information om mineralers     fysiska egenskaper studeras och l&#xe4;ggas in i en databas. Denna         information ska sedan kunna anv&#xe4;ndas vid prospektering av brytv&#xe4;rda   mineraler p&#xe5; ett stort djup.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through a collaboration between Uppsala University in Sweden and the  South African partners: the University of Witwatersrand and the       Council for Scientific and Industrial Research, the information on    mineralers physical properties will be studied and put into a         database. This information will then be used for exploration of deep  mining.</narrative>
  </description>
